Original file was 11,403,698 bytes (11.4MB) of near-identical repeated
'[ok] Processed N frames...' lines, produced by the infinite-loop bug
described in data/EVOLUTION.md Era 8 (Camera dummy_mode never returning
frame_bytes=None, combined with the LLM calling a tool with a fake video
path against instructions). The process ran for 2 hours 20 minutes before
being killed. This truncated file preserves the START of that run as
evidence it genuinely began looping; the remaining ~11MB was identical
in kind and added no further information.
